# Source card imagery for tools/make_card.py: user-supplied, often copyrighted.
# Only the generator is committed; assets/cards/ (or a symlink to the shared
# library, see tools/cards_dir.sh) and the baked masks it produces are rebuilt
# by `make` and never checked in.
assets/cards
cartridge/cards_data.go

# Card holder CAD. The tracked source of truth is the build script
# (cad/fusion/build.py) plus the parameter table, the derived reference geometry
# (cad/parameters.json, cad/reference/board.json) and the target document name
# (cad/fusion/target.json). Fusion documents live in Autodesk's cloud and cannot
# be saved locally as live files, so the only local CAD outputs are generated.
# The STEP is committed on purpose: it is ASCII, diffable, and the one copy of
# the geometry that needs neither Fusion nor an Autodesk account. Everything
# else is a build product.
cad/export/*.stl
cad/export/*.3mf
cad/export/*.f3d
cad/export/*.png
cad/fusion/*.f3d
__pycache__/
*.pyc

.DS_Store
